index ea1a1a0..1da22bb 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,24 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.FilesService.Upload`, which uploads a file from a file name and an
+  `io.Reader` without hand-building the multipart body, with `WithUploadFile*`
+  options for associating the file with a deal, person, organization, product,
+  activity, lead or project. The multipart body it builds is replayable, so
+  the retry policy applies to these uploads.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Requests sent through `Raw.Do` with a seekable body (an `*os.File`, or any
+  `io.Reader` that implements `io.Seeker`) are now replayed on retry.
+  Previously only `*bytes.Buffer`, `*bytes.Reader` and `*strings.Reader`
+  bodies got a `GetBody` from `net/http`, so uploads such as
+  `v1.FilesService.Add` failed immediately on 429/5xx instead of retrying,
+  even with `RetryPolicy{RetryAllMethods: true}`. Non-seekable readers are
+  still streamed once and never retried.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
